 *
 * Input Parameters:
 *   i2s - A reference to the I2S interface.
 *   apb - A reference to the audio pipeline buffer.
 *   arg - A void reference to the driver state structure.
 *   result - The result of the last transfer.
 *
 * Returned Value:
 *   None.
